  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">5단원 동물과 에너지 / 배설 부분에서 활동한 자료 올려봅니다.<br>김신연선생님 자료 참고하고, 네프론 모형 2인 1조로 구입해서 해봤습니다. (김신연선생님 감사합니다. ^^)<br>네프론 모형은 빵끈으로 고정시키고 양면테잎으로 부착해서 교실 뒤에 게시해두었습니다.<br>보시는 콩팥 이미지는 A1사이즈 입니다. 사이즈 참고하세요~ ^^</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bec3c99fe3181c47d34f8f9966eccadd5164902?download\" data-file-name=\"우리반콩팥만들기-우(전지).JPG\" data-file-size=\"67590\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D377%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20210924172850&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6bec3c99fe3181c47d34f8f9966eccadd5164902')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">우리반콩팥만들기-우(전지)</span><span class=\"type\">.JPG</span></div><div class=\"size\">66.01KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9be56931c5d3c5e60fc900f42a4e9a45297ff426?download\" data-file-name=\"우리반콩팥만들기-좌(전지).jpg\" data-file-size=\"113571\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D377%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20210924172850&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F9be56931c5d3c5e60fc900f42a4e9a45297ff426')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">우리반콩팥만들기-좌(전지)</span><span class=\"type\">.jpg</span></div><div class=\"size\">110.91KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb677216db88d2e58573627e91a88909cf2ab1a6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb677216db88d2e58573627e91a88909cf2ab1a6\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-